    "conversion_check": {
      "description": "For encoded labels, clipped progress plus residual reconstructs the demonstrated commanded world TCP position exactly, including the near-coincident endpoint convention. Compare decoded FK position in metres, rotation angle in radians and gripper scalar to that commanded target. Joint nonuniqueness is allowed; sampled alpha is projected to [0,1] and sampled 6-D rotation to SO(3).",
      "mode": "task_space",
      "tolerance": 0.005
    },
    "cut_relation": "Covers every action in all twelve assigned [600,stop) segments without trimming. It preserves the complete 250-action [600,850) overlap per trajectory with red_transfer, totaling 3,000 supervised overlap actions through red release, transit, blue approach, closure and lift.",
